An AppImage built by packaging/appimage/build.sh is a Rust binary. The tray
(ksni) and the windows (slint, FemtoVG) are linked into it. Qt, PySide, and
CPython are not in this image.

Shared libraries copied next to the binary are listed in LIBS.txt. They
keep their own licenses. Typical names are fontconfig and freetype. glibc
is not bundled. Wayland, xkbcommon, libGL, libEGL, and the GPU driver are
not bundled either: the host provides them, so the window can composite
transparent corners.

Dependencies added later must be listed in this file, with their
copyright and license, before a release.
